Package: trama
Title: Interactive Node-Graph Computation with Live Previews
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Mambelli Fernandes", , "pedromambelli@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-1695-279X")),
    person("João Paulo Assis", "Bonifácio", , "jpab.27@hotmail.com",
           role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2335-8391"))
  )
Description: Build and run computation graphs interactively. Nodes are typed R
    functions with declared ports and parameters; a flow is a plain JSON
    document; execution is pull-based, content-addressed and incremental, so
    editing a parameter recomputes only what depends on it. Every node renders
    its own result in the canvas with a registered renderer, making each step
    of a pipeline visible rather than implied. Domain knowledge lives entirely
    in registrable collections, never in the core, so new domains are added
    without modifying the package.
